2	line	Sanfew	Well, what I'm struggling with right now is the meats needed for the potion to honour Guthix. I need the raw meat of four different animals for it, but not just any old meats will do.
2	line	Sanfew	Each meat has to be dipped individually into the Cauldron of Thunder for it to work correctly.
