2	line	Sanfew	Thank you so much adventurer! These meats will allow our potion to honour Guthix to be completed, and bring one step closer to reclaiming our stone circle!
2	line	Sanfew	Now go and talk to Kaqemeex and he will introduce you to the wonderful world of herblore and potion making!
